Error [E0307]: This `if` doesn't cover every `[String:Int]` value — it needs an `else` arm
  --> pattern_ratified_map_non_exhaustive.jet:2:3
    |
  2 |   if values == {
    |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every arm tests part of the value's shape, so some values match no arm
 Fix: Add `else -> { … }` after the last arm
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0307
